          "content": "var pile = player.get_pile(\"deck\")\nvar card = game.get_card(\"reliable_axe\", pile)\nif card == null:\n\tgame.log(\"玩家游戏牌堆中没有【值得信赖的斧子】牌\")\nelse:\n\tplayer.equip(card)\nvar result = player.choose(\"请选择你抓取的拾荒卡颜色：\", [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"])\nvar scavenge_pile = player.get_scavenge_pile(result)\nplayer.draw_scavenge(1, scavenge_pile)"
